      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "PARTY WITH TOM (8) is a capable type and proved too classy last time to win by 4.5 lengths at Capalaba in a handy 20.19 beating Aston Surpass. Has won two of three starts from this draw. Ideally placed to take this out. LET'S GO OTTO (2) showed little early speed at his last couple, the latest finishing seventh (21.16) in a Grade 5 at this track. Key runner who gets his chance to atone. LEVCHENKO (1) has been settling off the speed lately, finishing eighth (20.72) last time in a Grade 5 at Capalaba. Yet to win out of this box but has been in the placings two times from four starts. Will give the top chances plenty to think about.",
